WEBVTT

11:33.351 --> 11:35.518
Okay, everybody, come on.

11:35.603 --> 11:38.563
Everybody settle down.
Now, kids. Everybody...

11:38.648 --> 11:42.400
You sit in a circle. No, Andy.
Andy, you sit in the middle there.

11:42.485 --> 11:46.529
Good. And... Which present
are you gonna open first?

11:46.906 --> 11:49.658
-Mine!
-There they are.

11:50.576 --> 11:52.452
Come in, Mother Bird.
This is Alpha Bravo.

11:52.536 --> 11:54.788
-This is it! This is it! Quiet, quiet!
-Come in, Mother Bird.

11:54.872 --> 11:57.999
All right, Andy's opening
the first present now.

11:58.084 --> 12:00.919
Mrs Potato Head! Mrs Potato Head!
Mrs Potato Head!
